>> numbers := ['1,2,3'] 拆分: [','].
输出 写入: ['I got: '] + numbers 计数 + [' numbers.'],停止.
{ :i 输出 写入: ['number #'] + i + [':'] + (numbers 位置: i), 停止.} × 3.
>> beverages := ['Tea Or Coffee Or Milk Or Orange Juice Or Water'].
beverages := beverages 拆分: [' Or '].
输出 写入: ['We serve'], 停止.
{ :i 输出 写入: ['->'] + (beverages 位置: i), 停止. } × (beverages 计数).
输出 写入: (beverages 连接: [',']), 停止.
输出 写入: (numbers 连接: ['||']).
